    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Attendee Exclusion and Master List - Update Data Tables\n\n**Purpose:**\n- The purpose of this workflow is to update the Data Table master list by syncing the data from the Google Sheets master list to the Data Table master list.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 440
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1200,
        16
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "0397598d-b1de-4d51-9a82-add585bfb080",
      "name": "Sticky Note11"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Documentation\n- Runs every day at 6:00 PM PHT / 11:00 AM BST. OR User sync it manually.\n\n- Retrieves the four master lists from Google Sheets.\n\n- Compares the Google Sheets master lists against the Data Table master list.\n\n- If there are new records or changes, the workflow inserts or updates the corresponding records in the Data Table\n\n- If a record exists in the Data Table but no longer exists in the Google Sheets master lists, the workflow removes it from the Data Table\n\n- Google Sheets serves as the source of truth and is always treated as the most up-to-date version of the master lists.\n",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 440
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1200,
        448
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "80a2c160-413b-409e-a858-40ad2faf4888",
      "name": "Sticky Note62"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Important URL\n**Google Sheets Master List**:\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MHxgcQ3-jG5yhGQSfIUaPSp0bgqq85HX1nssHky_saE/edit?gid=0#gid=0",
